										<= Sign_demo $bog_smalljs_demo
						<= Sign_caption $mol_view
							sub /
								<= Sign_caption_text @ \Two files: the markup and the logic.
		<= Features $mol_view
			sub /
				<= Feature1 $mol_view
					sub /
						<= Feature1_title $mol_view
							sub /
								<= Feature1_title_text @ \Minimalistic
						<= Feature1_text $mol_text
							text @ \An incrementally adoptable ecosystem that scales between a single component and a full-stack local-first app.
				<= Feature2 $mol_view
					sub /
						<= Feature2_title $mol_view
							sub /
								<= Feature2_title_text @ \Optimal
						<= Feature2_text $mol_text
